ement REPLACES the earlier one, call supersede(new_sid, old_sid or old_answer, reason): recall then answers with the newest and lists the old as history. A real contradiction is left alone: recall shows CHOICE.","topic":"declare_topic(text) opens a NEST: what the following sentences are about (a noun phrase, at most 24 characters; particles are allowed: A社のB事業 is the nest B事業 with the の-arm A社). An event with no subject (「資料を送付した」) is placed in the open nest and its subject is the nest's centre; nothing is added to your text. Declare it again when the subject changes. A new session declares its own.","write":"write(text, role) puts the sentence through the SHAPE EXCHANGER (at most 64 characters). Every clause must have a shape: F1 「X の Y は A」, F2 「Y は A」, F3 an event with が を に で と, F4 an event with no subject (it is completed by the open nest). A clause with no shape (F0: no_unit, gap_is_not_a_particle, negated, question, no_predicate, no_relation, case_before_topic, two_topics, repeated_case_particle, coordination, value_not_noun) refuses the whole sentence, stores nothing and says why: rewrite it, or keep it with keep_unshaped. An accepted sentence is also woven (weave_span) when the loom can; if it cannot, it is stored anyway and the result says weave: refused(...). 1 回の write には事実を 1 つ、1 文で書く (one fact per write, in one sentence, no comma continuation, no second clause or sentence): the memory answers only from such a write; a value written together with other statements is kept as evidence but is never an answer."},"run_id":"s0016","task":{"caps":{"bridges":60,"constructed":0,"crosses":1073741824,"emit_attempts":0,"lookups":240,"max_L":2,"max_depth":0,"ops":1200,"reads":0,"recalls":240,"reports":240,"supersedes":120,"topics":32,"unit_chars":8,"views":240,"writes":240},"lang":"prose","mode":"record_only","task_id":"memory","text":"memory session","tiers":["WORD"]},"tools":["write","recall","lookup","read_sentence","status","commit","declare_topic","supersede","